      "text": "voice agent -You're building a customer support agent for Bookly, a fictional online bookstore. Customers\ncontact support for:\n● Order status inquiries\n● Return/refund requests\n● General questions about shipping, policies, password reset, etc. \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
